{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "癸未坐制於白雲菴，再考詳定，見有此注，方可傳焉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿僧佉，此云無著"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "他歷切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下去論云無著論也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "巨寒切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音地，此方\n擊鍾板也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音銑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斥非"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顯是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一物、二施者、三受者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "全文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一四洲同一日月、一蘇迷盧，乃至一六欲天、一初禪天，名一世界。如是千世界，同為二禪\n天所覆，名小千界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "復次，一千小千名一中千，\n其間總有十億初禪、一千二禪，同為三禪所覆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "復次，一千中千名為大千，\n其間總有萬億初禪、十億二禪、一千三禪，同為四禪所覆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四輪所成，三災\n所壞，火至初禪，水至二禪，風至三禪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如法\n界次第"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歌利即陳如也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲呼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此相義，論云：此相如星，應如是見。何以故？無智闇中\n有彼光故，有智明中無彼光故。夢亦復爾，無智闇中有此夢故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此見義，論云：人\n法我見如翳。何以故？以取無義故，夢中所執亦無義也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此識義，論云：識如燈。何以故？渴愛潤取緣，熾然於中著。夢中受取貪著亦然，覺來方知是夢也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T25n1510bp0776c24"}
